---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="About — Codie Shannon">
  <section class="container about">
    <div class="about-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">About / positioning</p>
      <h1 class="section-title">I build systems<br/>that have to work<br/><span>in the real world.</span></h1>
      <p class="lead">I’m Codie Shannon, a New Zealand software developer and contractor focused on business systems, workflow automation, integrations, internal tools and practical product engineering.</p>
      <div class="body-copy">
        <p>My work spans C#/.NET desktop and web development, business workflow software, Python/FastAPI, Node/TypeScript/Vue, SQL, document processing, QA tooling and Unity development.</p>
        <p>The common thread is controlled operation: explicit state, evidence, human review where needed, clear failure modes and software that communicates what it is actually doing.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="panel tech-corners">
      <div class="profile-visual" aria-hidden="true"><span>CS</span><i></i><b>SOFTWARE / SYSTEMS</b></div>
      <p class="eyebrow">Profile</p>
      <h2>Codie Shannon</h2>
      <p class="subtitle">Business Systems & Workflow Automation Contractor</p>
      <div class="facts">
        <span>Base</span><b>New Zealand</b>
        <span>Core</span><b>.NET · C# · Automation</b>
        <span>Web</span><b>Blazor · Node · Vue</b>
        <span>Also</span><b>Python · Unity · SQL</b>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </section>
  <section class="container principles">
    <article><span>01</span><h3>Build the useful thing.</h3><p>Start from the operational problem and prove the workflow before adding polish.</p></article>
    <article><span>02</span><h3>Keep boundaries visible.</h3><p>Review-first actions, explicit permissions and honest limitations beat magical automation.</p></article>
    <article><span>03</span><h3>Leave evidence behind.</h3><p>Tests, screenshots, release closure and readable repositories make the work inspectable.</p></article>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
.about{padding:110px 0 70px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.25fr .75fr;gap:58px;align-items:start}.section-title span{color:var(--accent-strong)}.body-copy{max-width:800px;margin-top:38px;color:var(--muted-strong);line-height:1.78;font-size:1.02rem}.body-copy p{padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
aside{padding:22px}.profile-visual{height:230px;position:relative;display:grid;place-items:center;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--line);background:linear-gradient(145deg,var(--panel-strong),var(--accent-soft));margin-bottom:24px}.profile-visual::before,.profile-visual::after{content:"";position:absolute;border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 24%,transparent);border-radius:50%}.profile-visual::before{width:240px;height:240px}.profile-visual::after{width:150px;height:150px}.profile-visual span{z-index:2;font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:4rem;color:var(--accent-strong)}.profile-visual i{position:absolute;left:20px;right:20px;bottom:35px;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,var(--accent),transparent)}.profile-visual b{position:absolute;bottom:14px;left:16px;color:var(--muted);font-size:.57rem;letter-spacing:.16em}
aside h2{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:2rem;margin:18px 0 5px}.subtitle{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}.facts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:9px 18px;margin-top:24px;padding-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-size:.78rem}.facts span{color:var(--muted)}
.principles{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);border-block:1px solid var(--line)}.principles article{padding:34px 26px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}.principles article:first-child{padding-left:0}.principles article:last-child{border-right:0}.principles span{color:var(--accent);font:700 .7rem ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,monospace}.principles h3{font-family:var(--font-display);font-size:1.4rem;margin:32px 0 10px}.principles p{color:var(--muted-strong);line-height:1.65}
@media(max-width:900px){.about,.principles{grid-template-columns:1fr}.principles article{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding-left:0}.principles article:last-child{border-bottom:0}}
</style>
